"For non-Steam games, Game capture requires adding a launch option to your "
"game's launcher. Select it to see and copy the required launch option. This "
"lets Clipper hook into the game's direct Vulkan output and capture only the "
"game window."
msgstr ""
"Display capture records your selected screen while this game is running.\n"
"\n"
"For non-Steam games, Game capture requires adding a launch option to your "
"game's launcher. Select it to see and copy the required launch option. This "
"lets Clipper hook into the game's direct Vulkan output and capture only the "
"game window."

